"<tools>\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (ls, grep, find, etc.)\n- agent_resume: Resume a restored subagent idle in its own session\n- agent_models: Discover subagent backends, model IDs, and Claude effort options\n- agent_spawn: Spawn background subagents (non-blocking) and manage them by id\n- team_create: Create a team of role-based background workers who message each other\n- team_succeed: Replace a team's ended coordinator or monitor\n- project_verbs: run, reload, inspect and tear down your own worktree's running copy of the project (up, apply, logs, status…)\n\nIn addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\n</tools>"
